#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:3
#: a20c9903d40e44a99724696c2900060b
msgid "自旋螺旋（Spin Spiral）"
msgstr "Spin Spiral"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:5
#: 7722a9ce940f49c8b3ac4908edd28291
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:7
#: 21e78c95c9c8466fb740d35fc7f1bb4f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:9
#: 7b5694f14a444a29b8fba1d90715e87b
msgid ""
"对输入结构按一维相位场写入非共线 `initial_magmoms`，生成一批不同周期、相位、"
"手性和轴向分量的 spin spiral / helix / conical spiral 初始构型。支持两种等价"
"的主控方式：直接扫周期 L_D 或扫每 Angstrom 转角梯度。"
msgstr ""
"Write noncollinear `initial_magmoms` from a one-dimensional phase field, "
"generating spin-spiral, planar-helix, and conical-spiral initial states over "
"periods, phases, chiralities, and axial components. Control the spiral "
"either by scanning its period `L_D` or by scanning the rotation gradient in "
"degrees per Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:11
#: 793eb3cf8e1e496186c3dc70d5892ec7
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:13
#: 519cd267dc1c4b9ab17c3bb67c1034cf
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{m}(u)=\\sqrt{1-m_z^2}\\left[\\cos\\phi(u)\\,\\mathbf{e}_1+"
"\\sin\\phi(u)\\,\\mathbf{e}_2\\right] + m_z\\,\\hat{\\mathbf{n}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:15
#: c4e69d0116a245fcb09fdcab66511fa8
msgid "\\phi(u)=s\\cdot \\frac{2\\pi u}{L_D}+\\phi_0,\\qquad s\\in\\{-1,+1\\}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:17
#: c123f5e6b35c4fb98be93dae88ea0ca7
msgid ""
"其中 $m_z=m_\\parallel/|\\mathbf m|$ 是无量纲轴向分量。$m_z=0$ 为平面 "
"helix， $0<|m_z|<1$ 为 conical spiral，$|m_z|=1$ 是完全沿轴的共线极限。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:20
#: 49ad422bb0e14d9ca1bb005921f5706e
msgid ""
"**关键限制：** 这张卡只写入初始磁矩纹理，不改变晶体结构。如果当前晶格与目标周"
"期不相容，需要先扩胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Important limitation:** This card changes only the initial moment texture. "
"If the target period is incompatible with the current periodic cell, enlarge "
"the structure first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:22
#: c6986f5833de4a05b2695db4b4de16c2
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:24
#: 45601bb0e5eb46178d8281559055164f
msgid "场景：模型在螺旋磁结构上能量曲线完全不对"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: the predicted energy curve is wrong for spiral magnetic structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:26
#: d88281946ef848939fcb936b2ef1e557
msgid ""
"你训练了一个 NEP 模型，训练集里有 FM 和 AFM 构型。模型在共线磁序上表现尚可，"
"但一跑到具有螺旋磁序的构型（如 CrNb3S6 或 MnSi 中的 chiral helimagnet），能量"
"曲线形状完全错误——周期依赖的能量极小值位置偏离 DFT 结果超过 30%。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model with FM and AFM configurations. It performs "
"acceptably for collinear orders, but for spiral states such as chiral "
"helices in CrNb3S6 or MnSi, the shape of the energy curve is wrong and the "
"period-dependent minimum differs from DFT by more than 30%."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:28
#: 6ba4e316cf4a4c05826497c717054d0b
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 模型从未见过磁矩在空间中连续旋转的构型。FM/AFM 训练集隐式告诉"
"了模型\"磁矩方向在空间中是分段常数\"的假设。需要在训练集里加入不同周期的螺旋"
"磁纹理，让模型学习 q 空间不同波矢下的能量响应。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The model has never seen moments rotate continuously through "
"space. FM and AFM examples cover only a few discrete directional patterns. "
"Add spiral textures over several wave vectors so the model can learn the "
"energy response `E(q)` across the relevant region of reciprocal space."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:30
#: 670857f9576e4f6f8c1a50616a9889ed
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个已知磁矩幅值的磁性结构（如 MnSi 单胞，Mn 磁矩约 2.0 μB，螺旋"
"沿 [111] 方向）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A magnetic structure with known moment magnitudes, such as an "
"MnSi cell with approximately 2.0 μB on Mn and propagation along [111]."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:32
#: 5afa53e4a4ff4e1a85ceafa2f835338f
msgid ""
"**目标：** 沿 [111] 方向扫描 3 个周期（20/30/40 Angstrom），3 个全局相位"
"（0/30/60 度），纯 helix（mz=0），正反手性成对。共 3x3x2 = 18 个螺旋构型"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Along [111], scan three periods (20, 30, and 40 Å), three global "
"phases (0°, 30°, and 60°), a planar helix (`mz=0`), and both chiralities: 3 "
"× 3 × 2 = 18 structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:34
#: 7bc2b9a6c00a49d88f30934bbf5aaa22
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:35
#: a636aae805d2426a816772188f348d6f
msgid "`Propagation Axis` = `[1, 1, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:36
#: 7a64fdc0c9344f8f90af2d2eef50d1ae
msgid "`Spiral Parameter` = `Period (L_D)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:37
#: aab6f6fccb6c404d908697d139623a18
msgid "`Period Range` = `[20, 40, 10]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:38
#: f8c43d41474f4f5b92defa40edb39a39
msgid "`Phase Range` = `[0, 60, 30]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:39
#: 6f2afe9a907c40c9a2c368c69f958066
msgid "`m_parallel Range` = `[0, 0, 0.1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:40
#: 08afb37f0b034d88aa78becf0dca3d7c
msgid "`手性`（`chirality`） = `Both`"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:42
#: 4d52f26c09884a0bbbf2ff138c0a29ce
msgid ""
"**输出：** 18 个结构，磁矩沿 [111] 方向逐层旋转，带 "
"`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 18 structures whose moments rotate along [111], labeled "
"`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:44
#: 987e184c0f0b4730b357e538620f08d0
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:45
#: c1311491c4a6415f95c5b9dc5b5e7242
msgid "重训后用 DFT 计算几个螺旋构型的能量作为参考，对比模型预测的 E(q) 曲线"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, compare the predicted `E(q)` curve with "
"DFT energies for held-out spiral configurations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:46
#: e5bc3523cb3e49a89033e56551dbb8bf
msgid ""
"如果极小值位置仍偏离，加密 `周期范围`（`period_range`）扫描（例如 `[10, 40, "
"5]`）"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:47
#: d1edf134ce914bf09c641a9e1f3b8acf
msgid ""
"如果发现 conical spiral（mz != 0）的能量比纯 helix 更低，加入 `mz = [0, 0.5, "
"0.1]` 覆盖锥面螺旋"
msgstr ""
"If conical spirals with `mz != 0` are lower in energy than the planar helix, "
"add `mz = [0, 0.5, 0.1]` to cover axial components."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:48
#: f6c2c9c60a2148c680e56009c02a54c0
msgid "如果需要晶格相容的周期，勾选 `Period Filter` 开启整周期约束"
msgstr ""
"Enable `Period Filter` when only periods commensurate with the current cell "
"should be retained."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:50
#: d062da3ab11942e2be751f3884425cd4
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:52
#: b4ed0db797f74a4fbd92b3ff2442d2d0
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:53
#: 0c151abe37f04083b7dd376ea207f2d6
msgid "研究体系存在螺旋/非共线磁基态（如 chiral magnet、skyrmion 宿主材料）"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:54
#: 43e1341b82f94a8cb7cb85c6e7b9f32c
msgid "模型在非共线磁序上泛化失败"
msgstr "The model fails to generalize to noncollinear magnetic order."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:55
#: f8c0b5d5daa24529bb827e21ff68113c
msgid "需要系统覆盖 q 空间的磁激发"
msgstr ""
"You need systematic coverage of magnetic excitations over wave vector `q`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:57
#: f1fc95e138584f50bb3d12f3ec5ab137
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:58
#: 76dd9ca0f95643fa99656556f729ba0d
msgid "体系只有共线磁序 → `Magnetic Order` 够用"
msgstr "Only collinear order is relevant → `Magnetic Order` is sufficient."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:59
#: 60807313aa234c62b7a2a3a58764ca2f
msgid "需要局部小角度偏转而非长程螺旋 → 用 `Small-Angle Spin Tilt`"
msgstr ""
"You need local small-angle canting rather than a long-range spiral → use "
"`Small-Angle Spin Tilt`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:60
#: 859a847aeffe49d08be3d57be958cfef
msgid "晶体结构本身需要扩胞才能容纳目标周期 → 先扩胞再回来"
msgstr ""
"The target period does not fit the current cell → build a suitable supercell "
"first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:62
#: afd47cb1a6c947b486abbb2a8d163e28
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:64
#: 47e3b10151a54680b6a0755f4dc114e5
msgid "螺旋轴和周期"
msgstr "Propagation axis and period"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:66
#: 45e52ec3c1fa4404b2fde9914921ccb2
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:68
#: 19d11809a6bc455991798179d8566f75
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。螺旋相位"
"沿此方向传播，原子坐标在该方向的投影用于计算相位，格式 `[x, y, z]`。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Direction along which the phase propagates. Each atom's projected coordinate "
"on this axis determines its phase. Format: `[x, y, z]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:70
#: 901264168c5e45b7a1114836c67fa5b9
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:72
#: 6d6ae5e2beee4f2c93631de7e214e8a9
msgid "螺旋参数方式（spiral_parameter_mode）"
msgstr "spiral_parameter_mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:74
#: 2681aef069a741789dc115612dea4a41
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Period (L_D)'`。`Period (L_D)` 适合已知螺旋周期或要扫 E(q) 曲"
"线；`Angle gradient (deg/A)` 适合直接控制每埃旋转角。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Period (L_D)'`. Use `Period (L_D)` when scanning known "
"spiral periods or an `E(q)` curve. Use `Angle gradient (deg/A)` to control "
"rotation directly in degrees per Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:76
#: 6a339d518d354ea4bfec93d931145f9d
msgid "周期范围（period_range）"
msgstr "period_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:78
#: ddfa0dfb17cc4c8fb07e950f97617b24
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(20.0, 40.0, 10.0)`。"
"`[min, max, step]` 格式，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(20.0, 40.0, 10.0)`. "
"Period range in Å, expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:79
#: a02f661b413b4e2c9d003d165b543136
msgid "保守：`[20, 20, 5]`（单周期）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[20, 20, 5]` (one period)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:80
#: 698235cd9d0f45cc894c15475e915a17
msgid "平衡：`[10, 40, 10]`（4 个周期）"
msgstr "Balanced: `[10, 40, 10]` (four periods)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:81
#: 35f46c57a47f406d9a33a6140f7f5635
msgid "探索：`[4, 80, 4]`（宽范围）"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[4, 80, 4]` (broad range)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:83
#: 843cfa66dd1a43fabed208ff4094dfac
msgid "角度梯度范围（angle_gradient_range）"
msgstr "angle_gradient_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:85
#: b54e036900504d42a0bee7c9c26e9ef3
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(18.0, 18.0, 1.0)`。`[min, "
"max, step]` 格式，单位 deg/A。值越大旋转越快——360/L_D = 梯度。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(18.0, 18.0, 1.0)`. "
"Rotation-gradient range in degrees per Å, expressed as `[minimum, maximum, "
"step]`. The gradient is `360 / L_D`, so larger values correspond to shorter "
"periods."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:87
#: 54d0de8ca1f2429cb1380c38913946fb
msgid "层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr "layer_tolerance"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:89
#: 51b32669828b457c83d4b9143d29bd08
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.05`。投影差小于此阈值的原子归为同一层。仅在 `Layer-locked` "
"模式下生效。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Atoms whose projected coordinates differ by less "
"than this tolerance are assigned to the same layer. Used only in `Layer-"
"locked` mode."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:91
#: 2342b36882b2457c99e50d0815cb4bc4
msgid "仅生成公度周期（only_commensurate_periods）"
msgstr "only_commensurate_periods"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:93
#: 49ca8ccc3099403b9ea9affadda31ca8
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后只保留与当前晶格周期边界相容的周期，程序在指定区"
"间内自动搜索相容周期。如果没有相容周期，卡片会给出建议的超胞倍数。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `False`. Retain only periods commensurate with the current "
"periodic cell. The card searches the requested range and, if none fit, "
"reports a suggested supercell multiplier."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:95
#: 290725c52a1e449dbcf2455ee4ac1db5
msgid "相位和形状"
msgstr "Phase and spiral shape"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:97
#: 9043d6b07de04275a9e67a1068c848f3
msgid "相位范围（phase_range）"
msgstr "phase_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:99
#: 237297cc1ad84fcb923aa84935c61111
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 15.0)`。`[min, "
"max, step]`，全局相位偏移，单位度。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 15.0)`. "
"Global phase offsets as `[min, max, step]` in degrees."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:100
#: c9249befc1a44b8cb840668f95d3d6c4
msgid "保守：`[0, 0, 15]`（单个相位）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[0, 0, 15]` (one phase)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:101
#: 3194161232cd4ea091bd1be9d3ffe93d
msgid "平衡：`[0, 90, 30]`（4 个相位）"
msgstr "Balanced: `[0, 90, 30]` (four phases)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:102
#: 6089ecc99ecc41fbb1f948538136adca
msgid "探索：`[-180, 180, 30]`（全相位空间）"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[-180, 180, 30]` (full phase range)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:104
#: 549afbdd45cb4234b5a5012218829950
msgid "z 方向磁矩分量（mz）"
msgstr "mz"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:106
#: 0056c46b971e435b8369077116a0a6f9
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 0.1)`。沿传播轴"
"的单位化分量，范围 [-1, 1]。0 = 纯 helix，非零 = conical spiral。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 0.1)`. "
"Normalized component along the propagation axis, in `[-1, 1]`. Zero gives a "
"planar helix; a nonzero value gives a conical spiral."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:107
#: 89ec30e3fb5e472cb163d1e4890d3edc
msgid "保守：`[0, 0, 0.1]`（纯 helix）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[0, 0, 0.1]` (planar helix)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:108
#: 77ae0b12e1bf4f3685bacac63dadb43c
msgid "平衡：`[0, 0.5, 0.1]`（弱 conical）"
msgstr "Balanced: `[0, 0.5, 0.1]` (moderate conical component)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:109
#: 51bb6e9cc0d44d61a060885f13c3cf33
msgid "探索：`[-0.9, 0.9, 0.1]`（全 conical 空间）"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[-0.9, 0.9, 0.1]` (broad conical range)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:111
#: d5c5a1e94c354b3bb050ec4889465691
msgid "手性（chirality）"
msgstr "chirality"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:113
#: cf0a764cbc8d401a99b260ce17323eb8
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Both'`。`Clockwise` / `Counterclockwise` / `Both`。选 `Both` 会"
"对同一组参数生成一对手性相反的构型。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Both'`. Choose `Clockwise`, `Counterclockwise`, or `Both`. "
"`Both` generates a pair of opposite chiralities for every other parameter "
"combination."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:115
#: e6f5dadfbbc54be88c66eeae2db97ab3
msgid "相位模式（phase_mode）"
msgstr "phase_mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:117
#: 0a78c9e375f54f8da3f2bdc08b732c12
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Continuous by position'`。`Continuous by position`：每个原子按"
"自身投影坐标独立计算相位，适合标准连续螺旋。`Layer-locked`：先按投影坐标分"
"层，同层原子共享相位，适合层状体系。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Continuous by position'`. In `Continuous by position`, "
"each atom's phase follows its own projected coordinate. In `Layer-locked`, "
"projected positions are clustered into layers and all atoms in one layer "
"share a phase."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:119
#: 71d387a1d5b14d048f21841d0de30ecf
msgid "磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Moment magnitudes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:121
#: f13387d7c0124d028eecbe0fd7962204
msgid "磁矩大小来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "magnitude_source"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:123
#: fb829da040e14732abcd3fc29580fb85
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。可选 `Existing initial magmoms` 复"
"用已有磁矩，或 `Map/default magnitude` 用元素映射生成幅值。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Choose `Existing initial "
"magmoms` to reuse stored moments or `Map/default magnitude` to create "
"magnitudes from an element map."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:125
#: 9a0d9cd92f8e4ffea783ec17bb4624c7
msgid ""
"**`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）** / **`默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）**：仅在 "
"`Map/default magnitude` 模式下生效。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:127
#: 143250798cac4676ae342af48d176d38
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:129
#: 5deaea81a0f64958a4607e63c7e649d6
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。已知元素局域磁矩时显式写入，如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。未知元素不"
"要用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Provide known element-resolved local moments "
"explicitly, for example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`. Do not invent a prior for an "
"unknown element through a default value."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:131
#: 77b0ea3ce6544e08a584f146734d957e
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:133
#: cd38601a3e21494b987b34ad0ae0cee2
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）未命中元素的兜底幅"
"值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:135
#: ac76335e6f144cd5975a047fafe61cb1
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:137
#: 4a3898ecda4f45efbc1e54346d4b8b6a
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。限制哪些元素施加螺旋纹理，留空则全部参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Restricts the spiral texture to selected elements. "
"Leave empty to include all elements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:139
#: 862bd3ad718748a8b83e2bda03c5a7f1
msgid "输出预算"
msgstr "Output budget"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:141
#: 47a692e299ee463385076bf7c85bb685
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:143
#: 07677d67aaf542ffb90b9c3bb26f2104
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `100`。周期、相位、手性和锥角组合会迅速相乘放大输出数量。E(q) 曲"
"线先保留几十个点，全参数探索时再放大上限。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `100`. Periods, phases, chiralities, and axial components "
"form a Cartesian product. Keep an initial `E(q)` scan to a few dozen points, "
"then raise the cap only for a deliberate full-space study."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:145
#: 0cd05145291d4d4a9d82c48f8394456b
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:147
#: 87f1d9423cf44c5abaf6053ccd6d3d91
msgid "单周期纯 helix 验证（2 个输出，先确认方向正确）"
msgstr ""
"Single-period planar-helix check (2 outputs; verify propagation and "
"chirality)"

