#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:216
#: 04c856ec75654e9296857a9b7ce94e4d
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:218
#: 314f9fc436d848308e2b4c8e6f0e5423
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`：先确定局域磁矩模长，再扫螺旋周期和 mz"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`: establish local moment magnitudes, then "
"scan spiral period and `mz`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:219
#: 353294c6157c40c6a32ce7958f08eaa1
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Spin Spiral`：先统一写入磁矩幅值，再做螺旋"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Spin Spiral`: standardize moment magnitudes, then "
"impose the spiral."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:220
#: 2c478a62cffe46e8b982043f443b0c53
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Spin Spiral`：扩胞后容纳更长周期，再用整周期约束锁相"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` → `Spin Spiral`: enlarge the cell to accommodate longer "
"periods, then enforce commensurability."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:222
#: 377e2be4a39c4aefba80a970585557f5
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:224
#: 8bbc05f1003e48499838a5de6ad655df
msgid ""
"**输出为空 / 只有原始输入。** 磁矩幅值全为 0（检查 `磁矩大小来源`"
"（`magnitude_source`）和 `magmom_map`）。`Period Filter` 开启且区间内没有相容"
"周期——卡片会打印建议超胞倍数。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:226
#: cdcdfd67603840c6882c63547934a467
msgid ""
"**相邻层相位递进不对。** 检查 `Propagation Axis` 是否指向预期的传播方向。"
"`Phase Mode = Layer-locked` 时调整 `层容差`（`layer_tolerance`）。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:228
#: 3f647284f19a463abc59c83a000bf277
msgid ""
"**输出比预期的多很多。** `周期范围`（`period_range`）步长太小，或 `z 方向磁矩"
"分量`（`mz`）范围太宽。设 `最大输出数`（`max_outputs`）上限，先小步长试跑再扩"
"大。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:230
#: 5d1eae8302f242669172c2f207e6556a
msgid ""
"**conical spiral 的 mz 值看不懂。** mz 是无量纲比值 m_parallel / |m|，不是以 "
"mu_B 计的绝对磁矩。物理上它只能取 [-1, 1]。"
msgstr ""
"**The meaning of conical-spiral `mz` is unclear.** It is the dimensionless "
"ratio `m_parallel / |m|`, not an absolute moment in μB, and must lie in "
"`[-1, 1]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:232
#: 68e1f9f9912d4cccadba01392b96a3bc
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:234
#: af4823ae4bf8480cac43650d1d482cc4
msgid "`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)`：纯平面 helix"
msgstr "`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)`: planar helix"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:235
#: 747a4ac12c944a4eae9b2a5482c4253f
msgid "`Spiral(L=...,ph=...,mz=...,chi=...,ax=...)`：conical spiral"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:236
#: 3ec04f1b7a0f41978468333261f72775
msgid "附加 `pm=layer,ltol=...`：仅 layer-locked 模式"
msgstr "Additional `pm=layer,ltol=...`: present only in layer-locked mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:238
#: 84584576e2ae4718b1f18c6377ce4a0d
msgid ""
"所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`；内部同步维护 ASE `initial_magmoms` 三列向量别"
"名。"
msgstr ""
"All exported outputs use `spin:R:3`; an ASE `initial_magmoms` three-"
"component vector alias is kept in sync internally."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:240
#: 1fe5d4728bd04ce680d117757e3071f0
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:242
#: 2668ac976fc24312a81fc3766e81fcf4
msgid ""
"无随机性。相同输入结构与相同参数 → 严格一致输出。相位原点固定为传播轴最小投影"
"位置。"
msgstr ""
"Deterministic. The same input structure and parameters produce identical "
"output. The phase origin is fixed at the minimum projection along the "
"propagation axis."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "其中 m_z = m_parallel / |m| 是无量纲轴向分量。m_z=0 为平面 helix，m_z=0 "
#~ "为 conical spiral。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Here `m_z = m_parallel / |m|` is the dimensionless component along the "
#~ "propagation axis. `m_z = 0` gives a planar helix; nonzero `m_z` gives a "
#~ "conical spiral."

#~ msgid "如果极小值位置仍偏离，加密 `period_range` 扫描（例如 `[10, 40, 5]`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the position of the minimum remains inaccurate, densify "
#~ "`period_range`, for example to `[10, 40, 5]`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**：仅在 `Map/default magnitude` 模式"
#~ "下生效。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**: used only in `Map/default "
#~ "magnitude` mode."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `magmom_map` 未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元"
#~ "素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0`. Used only when an element is absent from "
#~ "`magmom_map`. List important magnetic elements explicitly; nonmagnetic "
#~ "elements should normally remain at 0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出为空 / 只有原始输入。** 磁矩幅值全为 0（检查 `magnitude_source` 和 "
#~ "`magmom_map`）。`Period Filter` 开启且区间内没有相容周期——卡片会打印建议超"
#~ "胞倍数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**No output is produced, or only the original input remains.** All moment "
#~ "magnitudes may be zero; check `magnitude_source` and `magmom_map`. "
#~ "Alternatively, `Period Filter` found no commensurate period in the "
